  "contract": "A High-Risk player in Western Plaguelands receives Honorable 9930870, and the login stream sends SMSG 0x0768 with the zone list 28 and 618. When an opposing High-Risk player attacks them, both receive Honorable Combat 9930871 and a third player can no longer attack the defender or be attacked by them, and heals between a locked player and anyone else are refused at cast and zeroed on landing. When the challenger kills the defender, the challenger earns realm-first achievement 10534 (6534 is its disabled WildCard copy) and the lock ends; the bystander earns none. Winterspring, pets, untargeted shields or buffs from third parties and the lock ending on leaving combat are untested.",
